---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import Hero from "../components/Hero.astro";
import PixelSky from "../components/PixelSky.astro";
import Mark from "../components/Mark.astro";
---
<Base title="About Common Parcel" description="Common Parcel is independent HOA software, designed and built in Detroit by Jesse Bruner for volunteer boards and self-managed associations." path="/about">
  <Hero><h1 class="t-display">Built for volunteer HOA boards.</h1><p class="t-lede">Common Parcel helps neighbors manage their own HOA or condominium association. It brings the paperwork, finances, and resident requests into one place.</p></Hero>
  <section class="about-story"><div class="page story-grid"><div class="story-art" aria-hidden="true"><PixelSky mode="scene" scene="hilltop" seed={401} /></div><div><h2 class="t-sheet">Your time matters<br />as much as the work.</h2><p>Running an association means looking after shared places and shared money. It also means invoices, minutes, contracts, and a surprising number of documents.</p><p>Common Parcel brings that work together. Our aim is to spend less of your time on spreadsheets, repeated questions, and missing records, so your board can focus on the neighborhood.</p><p>Clear records help today’s board. They give tomorrow’s board a better start, too.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="principles"><div class="page"><div class="principle-grid">{[["Plain English", "People should be able to understand the next step without learning a new vocabulary."], ["Careful decisions", "Useful software brings the facts closer. The people responsible for the association make the decisions."], ["Lasting records", "Minutes, contracts, and financial records should remain available when a new board takes over."]].map(([title, text]) => <div><h2 class="t-headline">{title}</h2><p>{text}</p></div>)}</div></div></section>
  <section><div class="page founder"><div class="founder-card"><Mark size={48} /><p>Jesse Bruner</p><span>Founder · Detroit, Michigan</span></div><div><h2 class="t-sheet">Designed and built in Detroit.</h2><p>Common Parcel is an independent software company founded by Jesse Bruner. Have a question about your association, or something you wish worked better? You can reach Jesse directly.</p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:jesse@commonparcel.com">jesse@commonparcel.com <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></div></section>
</Base>
<style>
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; align-items: center; gap: 72px; }.story-art { height: 440px; background: var(--night); }.story-grid h2 { margin-bottom: 24px; }.story-grid p:not(.eyebrow) { color: var(--ink-2); }.principles { background: var(--field); border-block: var(--stroke-edge); }.principle-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 48px; margin-top: 30px; }.principle-grid p { font-size: 16px; color: var(--ink-2); }.founder { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; align-items: center; gap: 72px; }.founder-card { border: var(--stroke-edge); padding: 40px; background: var(--field); }.founder-card p { font: 450 29px/1.2 var(--font-serif); margin: 24px 0 12px; }.founder-card span { font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-3); }.founder > div:last-child > p:not(.eyebrow) { max-width: 35em; }
  @media(max-width: 760px) { .story-grid, .founder, .principle-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 30px; }.story-art { height: 270px; }.principle-grid > div { border-top: var(--stroke-edge); padding-top: 24px; } }
</style>
